# Project Structure

## Standard Structure

```
project-root/
├── SPEC.md                 # Project specification
├── .cursor/rules/         # Cursor AI rules
├── README.md              # Project overview
├── docs/                  # Static documentation (optional)
├── memories/              # AI knowledge base
└── src/                   # Source code
```

## Memory System Integration

- **Use `memories/` folder** for AI-assisted knowledge management
- **Route content appropriately**: facts→knowledge, plans→plans, issues→issues
- **Include YAML frontmatter** in all markdown files for AI discoverability
- **Export conversations** using `mem export-conversation` for important discussions
